      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"462 characters\">Fixed Rate - No Bargaining I Quotation is valid for only 07<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"462 characters\">days.<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"462 characters\">1) Warranty Period is ONE Year from the date of Installation.<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
